  "notes": "Register table 'Address (HEX)' is protocol (0-based): outputs 1-8 = coils 0x0000-0x0007 (FC01/05/0F), inputs 1-8 = discrete inputs 0x0000-0x0007 (FC02; wiki writes '1x0000...1x0007'), output control mode = holding 0x1000-0x1007 ('4x1000...4x1007', FC03/06/10), UART 0x2000, device address 0x4000, software version 0x8000. address_base=0, no conversion. Write-only commands (all-output 0x00FF, flash on/off 0x0200-0x0207 / 0x0400-0x0407) are not modelled. Default communication format 9600,N,8,1 and default address 1 are stated in the Specification table. UART register: high byte parity 0x00-0x02, low byte baud mode 0x00-0x07 (4800..256000, same mapping as the relay module); the enum only lists the no-parity values. In Linkage mode (1) outputs cannot be controlled by command (wiki note). Software version = value/100.",
